  "english_paragraphs": [
    "My good friend and I both have children. I have a daughter, and she has a son. My daughter was born on Thursday, February 16, 2017. My friend’s son’s birthday is June 30. His birthday is coming up soon. I wonder what gift he would like?"
  ],
  "english_full": "My good friend and I both have children. I have a daughter, and she has a son. My daughter was born on Thursday, February 16, 2017. My friend’s son’s birthday is June 30. His birthday is coming up soon. I wonder what gift he would like?",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Мо́й хоро́ший друг и я име́ем де́тей. У меня́ до́чка, а у неё сы́н. Моя́ до́чка роди́лась в четве́рг, 16 февра́ля 2017 го́да. У сы́на мо́ей знако́мой день ро́ждения 30 и́юня. Его́ день ро́ждения ско́ро. Мне интере́сно, какóй да́р он жела́л бы."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Moy khoróshiy drug i ya iméyem détey. U menyá dóchka, a u neý sýn. Moyá dóchka rodílas' v chetvérg, 16 fevrálya 2017 goda. U sýna móey znakómay den' rodízhdeniya 30 iyúnya. Egó den' rodízhdeniya skóro. Mne intereśno, kakój dár on zhelál by."
  ],
